    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617af9b48cb76918cc014b59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伊丽莎白女王杯结束后・你……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c518e45368cabe1478713634389c4f4e511ef55a0ae918e48119b32f1e81accb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de33cb5b10bbaec94fc8fd31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥突然听说伏特加要进军国外，\n感到非常吃惊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0179e72e454fcd6c6d542f9e68b85e60cace692e71dd1a6752a1b9effc485b92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907709d0f9ed0b618394bc8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被独自留下的大和赤骥，\n回顾着与伏特加之间的回忆──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d8ed679215c816f56e150dfad1b49c9f0047f9f24078aacf7df99c38d163b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d8cf9ada1b2b771a30d600",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时想要成为“第一”的意念\n也逐渐变得强烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8a5a483a6b2535130e6932b83ca15114ee26de980efbaf257eac8055fe2d57a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24506dc86e370ce0a364e1e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空荡荡的房间",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be135195cef4c52e6e3baf95e394d02a1bd9034367765ca185650376a77d0ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30bae969061fea3d36649006",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "GⅠ“大阪杯”终于要开始了。\n大和赤骥一副游刃有余的样子──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe67591600d7a944356cbee029c510014a119ccd7acc9400db520e75ef91e65d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cdd7376fba235ebd86ae5f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她冲劲十足地表示会华丽获得“第一”，\n让所有人见识自己的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d30c3fe91ff8dcce674c97365cbeba50a71f45176d5d21e5ac198c3a3c2eac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e993deb2a578edb86b450f07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向大阪杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "4423575424741415861c85b2043870db30adb78bc366fd97792335ee5949271c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fc6f0df5ac7b4dea8d0aa12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥战胜了许多强敌，\n在“大阪杯”获得胜利后，\n暂时回国的伏特加向她再次下了战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f16d87fdca69533dc007ab0763c935eb76ece584e02fadb9298d42848e6ad92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac6dbe1d40708d5bec7bab3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决战的舞台就是“天皇赏（秋）”。\n赌上古马级赛马娘的最高荣誉，\n两人决定在这场比赛一分高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e9f91a6aeed45442dc2836345cb1db926a7e2f9d4fbe4eec2e16936c075012a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97badc5c15bb39045a22607a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大阪杯结束后・一分高下",
      "source_fingerprint": "00f0fe86e03a73a055d07d77a7bbf762778b8b94b02752b50556a767098c0697",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4e49659f5627ebff9a2df5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥以一步之差错失“大阪杯”的胜利，\n此时暂时回国的伏特加向她再次下了战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21ed3dd393af5d33b7df90c02dea57cba5e15c08403eca839bd3516a8e2c8cf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ca49d7ce20ecc6a8a3df69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决战的舞台就是“天皇赏（秋）”。\n赌上古马级赛马娘的最高荣誉，\n两人决定在这场比赛一分高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e9f91a6aeed45442dc2836345cb1db926a7e2f9d4fbe4eec2e16936c075012a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1009/storytimeline_501009430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
